Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:30.80,H_en,,0,0,0,,The heiress lost everything... now she begs on her knees
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:30.80,C_en,,0,0,0,,Watch ALL episodes FREE ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:00.94,S_en,,0,0,0,,Stop pushing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.54,0:00:03.50,S_en,,0,0,0,,The whole 28th floor is Shen Xiujin's.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.02,0:00:05.38,S_en,,0,0,0,,Without a key card you can't get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.78,0:00:10.68,S_en,,0,0,0,,Jian Tong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.72,0:00:12.12,S_en,,0,0,0,,Miss Jian.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.85,0:00:15.85,S_en,,0,0,0,,You've truly opened my eyes today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.89,0:00:17.13,S_en,,0,0,0,,The once proud Miss Jian,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.69,0:00:18.81,S_en,,0,0,0,,now to beg for mercy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.29,0:00:21.25,S_en,,0,0,0,,humbles herself in front of everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.29,0:00:22.33,S_en,,0,0,0,,hugging a servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.69,0:00:24.19,S_en,,0,0,0,,Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.89,0:00:26.93,S_en,,0,0,0,,if old Jian Zhendong found out,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.87,0:00:29.23,S_en,,0,0,0,,wouldn't he die of shame?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.58,0:00:30.78,S_en,,0,0,0,,The Jian family has no Jian Tong.
